# Base URL of the ASP.NET Core Web API.
# Copy this file to .env.local and adjust as needed.
#
# Local development - the browser calls the API directly:
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:5080

# Deployed behind the /api/* proxy instead, set BOTH of these:
#
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=same-origin
#   API_PROXY_TARGET=http://rmstesting.runasp.net
#
# "same-origin" makes the client use relative paths, and API_PROXY_TARGET is
# where next.config.ts forwards them server-side. Needed because the frontend is
# served over HTTPS while the API host has no TLS, and a browser will not let an
# HTTPS page call an HTTP endpoint.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* is inlined at BUILD time, so changing it on the host and
# restarting does nothing - the frontend has to be rebuilt.
